              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Avineli aneena na atumĩa ma Isilaeli, Mavinda ala mavitu nĩmwamanthie Ndaviti ethĩwe mũsumbĩ wenyu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
