        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla Avineli watũngiwe Eviloni, Yoavu amũtwaa ũtee mbingĩlonĩ katĩ aneene nake mbola, na amũtonyea ĩvu vo, na akw’a, nũndũ wa nthakame ya mwana‐a‐ĩthe Asaeli. ",
